I go --

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:48.000
[ Laughter ]
-No, I go --

00:02:49.567 --> 00:02:50.901
-Oh, that's good.
That's good.

00:02:50.901 --> 00:02:52.734
-Yeah.
What do you do?

00:02:52.734 --> 00:02:53.601
-Ahh!

00:02:53.601 --> 00:02:55.300
